  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "c48ca2db-5299-4bfe-a34f-ac3a27d69e98",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao significado em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1661e3ee-bc84-4807-977e-28a2b84a2395",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a frase, escute o áudio e ligue a cena ao significado.</p><p><strong>Hablo español.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu falo espanhol.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f8efb92de7184ed198c1395960e1a0f9_l01b01-hablo-espanol.png?Expires=1794099392&Signature=l9sAz8gL7NS6~tgQihINNjNw95BmUWpFTBKNvuxQ2jYcT9Z2WQBQJmV-Ur5ZSHOOdqYUR8JNZUmmnQX-oicxuD9goJsDfDcDrybZ5RNe5F0x~jxxlZdLTg3j5c2ArplWfftc2QI6-N6XI2iKoekyQRBJTHk77u2Yco1qwj8fzlNBzuAFiku13SK5161J6Fy3eyGdVeFfrbTbM8rQSImBrzxvcjsu7N7FfPGtfmps28oHjFmQNR1s8ZxSGUR8bu3aaOZlfJlDS94IiJBpxHJSQLDxzYB6W1zJcBWF8Mqr7zCMk6p5oAPxbX2kMRH-o-zi7y828b6ccv0qf9X5R6Wc1g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
